      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are there performance differences between these two ops where if you did actually know for sure what the texture format would always be, you\u0027d want to use OpImageFetch?\n\nI\u0027m assuming that OpImageFetch needs to know the format as well. Does it also require storage usage? In that case, the sksl author can just add the format to the layout and get the fetch behavior they want.  Or are we losing a way to to do OpImageFetch for textures that aren\u0027t storage?",
